# sort and top without by (DS0121, with a fix). The keys still parse.
mode: syntax
---- query
t | sort x desc | top 3 x
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..26
  PIPELINE@0..25
    NAME_REF@0..1
      IDENT@0..1 "t"
    WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
    PIPE@2..3 "|"
    WHITESPACE@3..4 " "
    SORT_OP@4..15
      IDENT@4..8 "sort"
      WHITESPACE@8..9 " "
      SORT_KEY@9..15
        NAME_REF@9..10
          IDENT@9..10 "x"
        WHITESPACE@10..11 " "
        IDENT@11..15 "desc"
    WHITESPACE@15..16 " "
    PIPE@16..17 "|"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    TOP_OP@18..25
      IDENT@18..21 "top"
      WHITESPACE@21..22 " "
      LITERAL@22..23
        LONG@22..23 "3"
      WHITESPACE@23..24 " "
      SORT_KEY@24..25
        NAME_REF@24..25
          IDENT@24..25 "x"
  WHITESPACE@25..26 "\n"

error[DS0121]: missing `by` after `sort`
  --> query:1:10
  |
1 | t | sort x desc | top 3 x
  |          ^ expected `by` before this
  |
  = help: insert `by`: `sort by x desc`

error[DS0121]: missing `by` after `top`
  --> query:1:25
  |
1 | t | sort x desc | top 3 x
  |                         ^ expected `by` before this
  |
  = help: insert `by`: `top 3 by x`

with the machine-applicable fixes applied:
    t | sort by x desc | top 3 by x
which parses without errors
